      "native_text": "Will Hensley – Director\nWill joined Coulton Creek Capital as the third employee in 2015. During his tenure, Will has\nbeen involved in almost every aspect of Coulton Creek. In his current role as Director, Will is\nresponsible for sourcing new investment opportunities, as well as underwriting, due diligence\nand portfolio management duties.\nPrior to joining Coulton Creek, Will worked in commercial banking where he acquired a diverse\nskill set included underwriting and portfolio management, as well as experience and oversight of\ndistressed real estate assets.",
