      "native_text": "Scott Brown – Director\nScott joined Coulton Creek Capital as a Director in 2022. Scott is responsible for sourcing and\nunderwriting new real estate investment opportunities as well as assisting in portfolio\nmanagement and investor relations responsibilities.\nPrior to joining Coulton Creek, Scott worked at Real Capital Solutions, a Colorado-based real\nestate family office. Scott served as a member of RCS’ Investment Committee evaluating the\nrisks, cash flows, capital requirements, deal structuring, and the overall status of RCS’ portfolio.",
